### Hello World Application

```python
from fastapi import FastAPI
from pydantic import BaseModel

# Create app
app = FastAPI(
    title="My API",
    description="API description",
    version="1.0.0"
)

# Simple GET route
@app.get("/")
def read_root():
    return {"message": "Hello, World!"}

# Route with path parameter
@app.get("/items/{item_id}")
