### Q2: Compare FastAPI and Flask. When would you choose one over the other?

**Answer:**

**Head-to-Head Comparison:**

```
FASTAPI:
✓ Type hints (mypy compatible)
✓ Auto-validation (Pydantic)
✓ Auto-docs (OpenAPI/Swagger)
✓ Async/await support
✓ Performance (~10x faster)
✓ Better for APIs
✓ Modern Python (3.6+)
✗ Smaller ecosystem
✗ Less mature
✗ Fewer third-party integrations
✗ Steeper learning curve

FLASK:
✓ Simple, easy to learn
✓ Micro-framework (minimal)
✓ Huge ecosystem
✓ Widely used (battle-tested)
✓ Great for monoliths
✓ Good community
✓ More tutorials online
✗ Manual validation
✗ Manual docs (optional)
✗ Sync only (old async)
✗ Slower
✗ No type hints support
```

**Architecture Comparison:**

