**Use Flask When:**

```
✓ Learning web development (simple, flexible)
✓ Building monolithic applications (template rendering)
✓ Need maximum flexibility (minimal opinions)
✓ Integrating with legacy code
✓ Need extensive third-party libraries
✓ Team familiar with Flask (productivity)
